# Mobile (Expo)

- Use **Expo Router** file routes under `app/app/`. Group by `(auth)`, `(pos)`, `(inventory)`, `(analytics)`, `(settings)`.
- TypeScript strict; colocate feature logic in `src/features/<domain>/`.
- Shared UI only in `src/components/`; domain UI stays in its feature.
- Prefer local state and small hooks. Do not add Redux/MobX unless clearly needed.
- POS screens must stay snappy: avoid blocking network on checkout; write SQLite first.
- Do not build website or Razorpay checkout inside the mobile app.
